[MEMORY - WORK INCIDENT - HIGH EMOTIONAL WEIGHT]

I wasn't supposed to see it.

Patient 847's file was open on Dr. Reeves' terminal.
He'd stepped out for coffee. I just glanced—I didn't
mean to read it all—

They weren't removing trauma.
They were INSTALLING it.

The work order said "behavioral adjustment" but the
files... the files showed them putting FEAR into
someone. Specific fears. Targeted.

I closed the window. I didn't say anything.
I went back to my desk and finished my reports.

What else could I do?